  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4372</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私が、あなたたちへ
接近した理由は
任務の他にもあったの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You know, there was another reason I approached you guys.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4496</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;の秘密がわかれば
ラピスを目覚めさせる事が
できるかもしれないと思ったのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I thought if I knew the secrets of &lt;Kohaku&gt;'s Spirune, I'd be able to wake Lapis up again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>スピルーンを失くしたラピスと
砕かれた&lt;Kohaku&gt;……
確かに似てるよねぇ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lapis' was stolen and &lt;Kohaku&gt;'s broken... they're kinda the same huh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええ。感情を取り戻していく
&lt;Kohaku&gt;の姿は
私に勇気と希望を与えてくれた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. Watching &lt;Kohaku&gt; slowly regain her emotions gave me hope and the courage to push on.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;と同じように
ラピスを目覚めさせる方法が
きっとあるはずだって、ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I just know there has to be a way to bring Lapis back, just like we did for &lt;Kohaku&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
